WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,030 --> 00:00:07,350
Brother, what the hell

2
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:08,750
I just saw Cao Dani

3
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,430
He asked me if I had met his son

4
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,390
I said no

5
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,190
I'm stuck at his door and can't get out.

6
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,990
It’s been two years for me too

7
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:16,390
Cao Dani must have died long ago

8
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:17,790
Turned into a ghost and wandered in this building

9
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,230
Brother Xiaotian, go and take him away quickly

10
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:21,230
Zhu Shan, I got the stuff quickly
